@Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5190

### Salud del inventario (dominio)
POST {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulacion/salud-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LIC-RON-0001",
  "stockActual": 0,
  "stockMinimo": 5,
  "stockMaximo": 60
}

### Generación de SKU (dominio)
POST {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulacion/sku
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoria": "Herramientas",
  "producto": "Taladro",
  "secuencia": 7
}

### Merma con reposición sin cobro (dominio)
POST {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulacion/merma
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "motivo": "Danado",
  "cantidad": 2,
  "reponerSinCobro": true
}

### RFC 7807 - 404
GET {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test-error/not-found
Accept: application/json

### RFC 7807 - 400
GET {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test-error/bad-request
Accept: application/json

### RFC 7807 - 500
GET {{Licoreria.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test-error/server-error
Accept: application/json

###
